                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a loose manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef3942b5-1a52-4739-9a4a-73a2a0b3af6f",
                                                "sense_id": "d76dd24a-b4fb-3c22-8447-2989406b8ccc",
                                                "text": "It was an April Fool hoax, of course. 31200 had been rigged up with a single lightweight wooden [name] plate (loosely held on by Blu Tack)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25b61918-e345-3338-bc72-298f017336c1",
                                        "entry_id": "9eddc9fa-19f3-3c17-99c3-4860274a2cd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not tightly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59b6aa33-5612-4ed5-bd56-3594fcffafc8",
                                                "sense_id": "25b61918-e345-3338-bc72-298f017336c1",
                                                "text": "Insert all the bolts loosely, then tighten them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14eae5d0-58f6-37d6-87b5-f88ccf00f576",
                                        "entry_id": "9eddc9fa-19f3-3c17-99c3-4860274a2cd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Approximately."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c728820-67d9-4b93-b41b-6bf878490c50",
                                                "sense_id": "14eae5d0-58f6-37d6-87b5-f88ccf00f576",
                                                "text": "It's red, to use the term loosely, sort of brown and sort of orange, let's call it reddish."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83fdb3a9-ebdc-41da-8002-13bbe8daa035",
                                                "sense_id": "14eae5d0-58f6-37d6-87b5-f88ccf00f576",
                                                "text": "a comic loosely based on an Old Norse epic"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d6455ed-e7bf-482a-81da-8fd92ab47ed4",
                                                "sense_id": "14eae5d0-58f6-37d6-87b5-f88ccf00f576",
                                                "text": "It is loosely adapted by John Hodge from Irvine Welsh’s novel Porno which imagined them coming together again 10 years on; this of course is 20."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5135753-7d06-30e9-892e-baa793cdc23c",
                                        "entry_id": "9eddc9fa-19f3-3c17-99c3-4860274a2cd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used to indicate an imprecise use of words; short for loosely speaking"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da941913-afdb-4d73-9b19-8095c5322a58",
                                                "sense_id": "c5135753-7d06-30e9-892e-baa793cdc23c",
                                                "text": "A whale is, loosely, maybe very loosely, a fish."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
